# X2 langfuse/langfuse web, commit 829cf03bb7d4b120499c530d15f45edc7df633b5
# Hand-derived from the page files under web/src/pages/** (Next Pages Router; no pageExtensions override in next.config).
# Rule: every .tsx/.ts/.jsx/.js file under pages/ is one URL; index is dropped, [p] -> :p, [...p] and [[...p]] -> * (catch-all), _x and (x) segments stay literal (/project/~/*).
# Excluded: pages/_app, _document and _error, all of pages/api/** (API routes), the README.md files.
# Not applied: basePath, i18n.
